    "en": {
      "trackName": "Snake for Watch: io Games",
      "description": "Experience the ultimate classic snake game, reinvented specifically for your Apple Watch!\nForget about clunky screen swipes. We have designed an innovative control system that utilizes the unique hardware of your watch. Simply rotate the Digital Crown to steer your snake with absolute precision and smooth handling.\nFeatures:\n\t•\tDesigned for Apple Watch: Perfectly optimized for the watch interface, providing a seamless visual and gaming experience.\n\t•\tDigital Crown Control: Turn the crown to smoothly control your snake's direction. It is intuitive, precise, and highly responsive.\n\t•\tPlay Anytime, Anywhere: The perfect casual game for your fragmented time. Start a quick match directly from your wrist whether you are commuting, waiting, or just taking a break.\n\t•\tEndless Challenge: Eat dots, grow longer, avoid collisions, and constantly challenge your own limits to achieve the highest score.\nDownload now, turn the crown, and enjoy the pure fun of this classic arcade game right on your wrist!",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/snake-for-watch-io-games/id6760546811?uo=4",
